        "official_en_sha256": "e40478f4a244c618ab4f3cf0a89f22acaa4eedbf10857663525280ced069faff"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここは造船所だが、部外者がなんの用だ？\r\n怪しい動きをしたら即刻つまみ出すからな。",
        "official_en": "What’s an outsider like you doing here in the city shipyard? I’m warning you: if I see that you’re up to no good, I’m going to kick you out myself.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
