      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この技術を盾にすりゃ、\r\nどんな国とも平和的に関係を築けるだろうによ……。",
        "official_en": "We could probably foster peaceful relations with all others nations if we leveraged the technology that goes into them, but go figure...",
        "real_en": "If we used this technology to our advantage, we could build peaceful relations with any country..."
      },
