        "official_en_sha256": "6a1144e6b3e771c944337b5ac844e51c0fe82f1b7df34b3d9f9c06399480f588"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ふん。軍の出資ナシに\r\n飛空艇を作れると思っているのか？",
        "official_en": "Hmph, if you really think you can build airships without the military’s funding, be our guest.",
        "real_en": "Hmph. Do you think you can build airships without military funding?"
      },
      "review": {
