        "official_en_sha256": "44f8a8e0bab74f041f5e7046820353f07e572efa549464745e364ab7b9aa11e5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "無駄口を叩く暇があったら、\r\nひとつでも多く部品を作るんだな。",
        "official_en": "Instead of being a smart-mouth, why don’t you use that energy you’re wasting on whining to make more parts?",
        "real_en": "If you've got time to chatter, make another part instead."
