      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "貴様らの国にも飛空艇隊があったらしいが、\r\nうちの足元にも及ばないだろう？",
        "official_en": "I’ve heard you Grandsheltians have—ope, I mean, <text style=\"italic\">had</>—an airship squadron. But I bet it wasn’t as good as Dirnado’s.",
        "real_en": "I hear your country had an airship squadron too, but it couldn't hold a candle to ours, could it?"
